      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are right that \"accepting\" the ceiling doesn't stop the pain of the burn or the feeling of wasted effort.\n\nIt is a desperate and painful feeling to realize the end of a narrative you thought would forever matter.\n\nYou do not need to force a \"spark\" to realize that your life still has a different kind of value, one that doesn't depend on a singular \"hug\" or \"peak.\"",
      "source": "target",
